# This file exists so `storage/` is present in a fresh clone.
#
# Rule R8 in scripts/check-boundaries.ts fails when the layout map in
# docs/aika/README.md lists a directory that does not exist, and it skips only
# dot prefixed entries and node_modules. Uploaded files are runtime state and are
# ignored by .gitignore, so without this file a fresh clone would fail the gate.
